  "body": "## Bedwars+\nThe only resource pack you'll ever need for bedwars\n\n## Version Compat\nI'm updating it as best as I can, please ask for versions on my discord server\n\nCurrently supporting-\n\n- 1.21-26.2\n- 1.8 and prior\n\n### For more info, please check the gallery.\n\nMain textures changed-\n- TNT\n- All the wool variants\n- Ender Pearl\n- Hearts\n- Armour Bar (Detailed Armour Bar mods can override this)\n- Low Fire\n- Shorter Swords (2 pixels shorter)\n- Endstone\n- Critical and Enchanted hit particles\n- Iron (Recoloured)\n- Diamond, Gold and Emerald (Slightly recoloured)\n- Better block breaking animation\n\nI made this pack using packcrafter.net, this is not sponsored it's just a GREAT website.",
